# CanonicalStateWriterReferenceVectors.json is the determinism pin of 14 §16.6 and
# SnapshotFieldOrder.json is the field-order pin it is keyed to. Both are re-asserted on the
# cross-platform job's live legs — Linux x64 and Android ARM64. (The iOS ARM64 leg is authored and
# gated off with iOS itself, `16` D34.) Their line endings are pinned to LF so the files are
# byte-identical on every one of them, and so a one-row addition never diffs as a whole-file rewrite
# because someone's core.autocrlf disagreed. Same rule as Rng/ and game-data/.
*.json text eol=lf
